    <p class="about-grid__lead">Building the second time around.</p>
    <div class="about-grid__body">
      <p>I spent the first chapter of my career turning complicated technology into systems that worked—across consulting, enterprise platforms, and organizations operating at scale. Then I stepped away and chose to begin again.</p>
      <p>Cracked Builders is the second act: a public record of what I’m building, testing, and learning as AI rewrites the rules of software and business. No guru theater. No pretending the path is obvious. Just an experienced technology operator back at the workbench—building useful products, sharing honest lessons, and seeing whether success can be reproduced deliberately.</p>
